  "user_request_original": "Optimize an aperiodic 16-layer multilayer film on Ge (Icenogle) substrate with air incidence. Stack order: Air | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | ZnS | ZnSe (Querry) | Ge (Icenogle). Sixteen design variables: thickness_1 through thickness_16, each controlling one layer independently. Wavelength bands: 8000-11000 nm (maximize transmittance), 3000-5000 nm (minimize transmittance). Total layers fixed at 16. Materials: zns, ZnSe (Querry), Ge (Icenogle). Find thickness values that maximize LWIR transmission while suppressing MWIR without periodicity constraints.",
